      <span aria-current="page">Film incentives</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker">Directory</p>
      <h1>Film and TV incentives in Europe</h1>
      <p class="company-summary">
        {{ incentiveIndex.total }} schemes, each read from the fund's own published terms and checked on {{ incentiveIndex.updated }}. Open a country for how its scheme works, what it is worth after tax and when it actually pays, or work out the net value on your own spend in the
