    <h2>Ranked by what a production can reach</h2>
    <p>Best rate after tax, before caps and before the assumptions that depend on your production. The comparison tool does the rest.</p>
    <ul class="company-chips">
      {%- for i in incentiveIndex.ranked %}
      <li><a href="{{ i.url }}">{{ i.name }} <span>{{ i.rate_label }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    {%- for m in incentiveIndex.byMechanism %}
